  <description>&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to check your understanding, receive feedback, and practice key concepts from the module.&amp;nbsp; Please feel free to consult your notes and resources from the module as you work the problems (&lt;a id="" class="" title="3.3 Demonstration and Calculations" href="$WIKI_REFERENCE$/pages/gaafc3ac24393cefdd2e82687dd38245e" target="_blank"&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to open the demonstrations in a new tab).&amp;nbsp; You may wish to have scrap paper at hand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quizzes will be checked for completion but quiz scores will not be counted towards your semester grade.&amp;nbsp; You may take the quiz as many times as you wish.&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Completing the quiz is&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;required&lt;/strong&gt; as part of this pre-arrival learning experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To respond to questions that ask for a numerical value, input just the numerical value (no label, units, or words).&lt;/p&gt;</description>
